    },
    "Although the 2FA code is marked as optional, it's because we don't know if you have it enabled or just entered an incorrect password. Provide it if you have 2FA enabled.\n\nhttps://support.apple.com/102606": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Although the 2FA code is marked as optional, it's because we don't know if you have it enabled or just entered an incorrect password. Provide it if you have 2FA enabled.\n\nhttps://support.apple.com/102606"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "虽然双重认证代码标记为可选，但这是因为我们无法确定您是否已启用，或者只是输入了错误的密码。如果您启用了双重认证，请提供代码。\n\nhttps://support.apple.com/102606"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mã 2FA ghi là không bắt buộc vì app không biết bạn có bật 2FA hay chỉ gõ sai mật khẩu. Nếu bạn có bật 2FA thì nhập mã vào.\n\nhttps://support.apple.com/102606"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analysis": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
